Actually a subtle point: usage import — "Код выхода 0 даже если все строки — дубли" (exit code 0 even if all rows are duplicates) — and what if the file is completely empty? Zero events — no problem.

Another subtle point: duplicate detection happens before validation of each row; if any row is invalid → the whole transaction is rolled back (atomic file). Document this.

