`Application::find('App\Command\UsageImportCommand')` — find takes the command name, not the FQCN. Framework Application::find falls back to the service name via the Application extension's commandToServiceKey map? The framework's Application has `get()`, which can handle service IDs. Use `static::$kernel->getContainer()->get($className)` — the service ID is the FQCN ✓.

Change tester():

```php
$svc = self::getContainer()->get(static::class::class...
protected function tester(string $command, array $params = []): CommandTester
{
    $commandInstance = self::getContainer()->get($command);
    $tester = new CommandTester($commandInstance);
    $tester->execute($params);
    return $tester;
}
```

